{"content_hash": "c2a77d38af09412a", "version_id": 842, "article_id": 85, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Aramco buys 49% of Saudi AI company HUMAIN", "title_zh": "沙特阿美买下本国AI公司HUMAIN 49%的股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/020/863.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580163059128-129fad4b73fb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8aHVtYWlufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM1ODExNDh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by tangi bertin on Unsplash", "author": "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 133, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Saudi Arabia's biggest oil company is now a big part of a young AI company. The deal brings money and new computer power to both sides.", "lead_zh": "沙特最大的石油公司现在成了一家年轻AI公司的大股东之一。这笔交易给双方都带来了资金和新的算力。", "preview": "HUMAIN is an AI startup from Saudi Arabia. Until now, the country's sovereign wealth fund PIF owned all of it. On November 1, HUMAIN said Ar", "preview_zh": "HUMAIN是沙特阿拉伯的一家AI初创公司。此前，该国主权财富基金PIF全资持有它。11月1日，HUMAIN表示，沙特阿美将收购其49%的股份，PIF保留另外51%。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 826, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 51.275, "size_bytes": 308592, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 151, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 52.3, "size_bytes": 314784, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 151, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 56.075, "size_bytes": 337392, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 151, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 48.625, "size_bytes": 292752, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 151, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 51.575, "size_bytes": 310464, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 151, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@1fa389e/content/data/versions/842.json", "paragraphs": ["HUMAIN is an AI startup from Saudi Arabia. Until now, the country's sovereign wealth fund PIF owned all of it. On November 1, HUMAIN said Aramco will buy 49% of its shares. PIF keeps the other 51%.", "Aramco is the world's largest oil and chemical company. It will give HUMAIN some important AI assets. It will also put in about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. That is a very large amount of money.", "Aramco plans to use HUMAIN's AI systems in its own work. The goal is to turn smart AI tools into real use in industry. This should make Aramco's daily operations stronger.", "The two companies already work together in other ways. HUMAIN has also made laptops and AI models. Now the oil giant and the AI startup will grow side by side."], "paragraphs_zh": ["HUMAIN是沙特阿拉伯的一家AI初创公司。此前，该国主权财富基金PIF全资持有它。11月1日，HUMAIN表示，沙特阿美将收购其49%的股份，PIF保留另外51%。", "沙特阿美是全球最大的石油和化工企业。它将向HUMAIN转让一些重要的人工智能资产，还会注资约99亿沙特里亚尔，这是一笔非常大的钱。", "沙特阿美计划在自己的业务中使用HUMAIN的AI系统，目标是把智能AI工具变成工业中的实际应用。这应该会让沙特阿美的日常运营更强。", "两家公司已经在其他方面有合作。HUMAIN还做过笔记本电脑和AI模型。现在，这家石油巨头和这家AI初创公司将一起成长。"], "body": "HUMAIN is an AI startup from Saudi Arabia. Until now, the country's sovereign wealth fund PIF owned all of it. On November 1, HUMAIN said Aramco will buy 49% of its shares. PIF keeps the other 51%.\n\nAramco is the world's largest oil and chemical company. It will give HUMAIN some important AI assets. It will also put in about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. That is a very large amount of money.\n\nAramco plans to use HUMAIN's AI systems in its own work. The goal is to turn smart AI tools into real use in industry. This should make Aramco's daily operations stronger.\n\nThe two companies already work together in other ways. HUMAIN has also made laptops and AI models. Now the oil giant and the AI startup will grow side by side.", "body_zh": "HUMAIN是沙特阿拉伯的一家AI初创公司。此前，该国主权财富基金PIF全资持有它。11月1日，HUMAIN表示，沙特阿美将收购其49%的股份，PIF保留另外51%。\n\n沙特阿美是全球最大的石油和化工企业。它将向HUMAIN转让一些重要的人工智能资产，还会注资约99亿沙特里亚尔，这是一笔非常大的钱。\n\n沙特阿美计划在自己的业务中使用HUMAIN的AI系统，目标是把智能AI工具变成工业中的实际应用。这应该会让沙特阿美的日常运营更强。\n\n两家公司已经在其他方面有合作。HUMAIN还做过笔记本电脑和AI模型。现在，这家石油巨头和这家AI初创公司将一起成长。", "text": "HUMAIN is an AI startup from Saudi Arabia. Until now, the country's sovereign wealth fund PIF owned all of it. On November 1, HUMAIN said Aramco will buy 49% of its shares. PIF keeps the other 51%. Aramco is the world's largest oil and chemical company. It will give HUMAIN some important AI assets. It will also put in about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. That is a very large amount of money. Aramco plans to use HUMAIN's AI systems in its own work. The goal is to turn smart AI tools into real use in industry. This should make Aramco's daily operations stronger. The two companies already work together in other ways. HUMAIN has also made laptops and AI models. Now the oil giant and the AI startup will grow side by side.", "vocab": [{"word": "shares", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份", "note": "常指公司股票的一部分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "startup", "pos": "noun", "zh": "初创公司", "note": "新成立、发展快的公司", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sovereign wealth fund", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "主权财富基金", "note": "国家设立的投资基金", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "own", "pos": "verb", "zh": "拥有", "note": "own all of it 表示全资持有", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "asset", "pos": "noun", "zh": "资产", "note": "公司拥有的有价值的东西", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "invest", "pos": "verb", "zh": "投资；注资", "note": "put in money 也是注资的意思", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "industry", "pos": "noun", "zh": "工业；行业", "note": "industrial 是形容词形式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "operations", "pos": "noun", "zh": "运营；业务", "note": "常用复数，指公司的日常运作", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-02T00:59:06.345153", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "HUMAIN", "s": 0.3, "e": 1.175, "sm": 300, "em": 1175, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "is", "s": 1.175, "e": 1.288, "sm": 1175, "em": 1287, "cs": 7, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "an", "s": 1.288, "e": 1.413, "sm": 1287, "em": 1412, "cs": 10, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "AI", "s": 1.413, "e": 1.775, "sm": 1412, "em": 1774, "cs": 13, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "startup", "s": 1.775, "e": 2.2, "sm": 1775, "em": 2199, "cs": 16, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "from", "s": 2.2, "e": 2.412, "sm": 2200, "em": 2412, "cs": 24, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Saudi", "s": 2.413, "e": 2.75, "sm": 2412, "em": 2749, "cs": 29, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "Arabia", "s": 2.75, "e": 3.575, "sm": 2750, "em": 3575, "cs": 35, "ce": 41, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": ".", "s": 3.575, "e": 3.7, "sm": 3575, "em": 3700, "cs": 41, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "Until", "s": 3.7, "e": 3.95, "sm": 3700, "em": 3950, "cs": 43, "ce": 48, "si": 1}, {"i":